                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fa61671f-2c63-3442-8f42-ad22cea00f0b",
                        "entry_id": "c0a38299-5e7d-31e7-9849-4b9a1d1d36f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "в еврейском календаре первый месяц библейского и седьмой гражданского года"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ec5afb6-9900-447b-9832-13c84ef1f18e",
                                "sense_id": "fa61671f-2c63-3442-8f42-ad22cea00f0b",
                                "text": "Потому что посещающих Вечерю Господню (19 млн.) больше, чем посещающих религиозные праздники всех направлений иудаизма вместе взятых. На Вечере Господней присутствуют не только свидетели Иеговы. А шаблон можно и поменять. Лунный календарь и месяц нисан используют не только иудеи."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6586d4d9-20bc-4fae-bb61-a0f0957ce1f9",
                        "source_entry_id": "c0a38299-5e7d-31e7-9849-4b9a1d1d36f9",
                        "source_sense_id": "fa61671f-2c63-3442-8f42-ad22cea00f0b",
                        "target_lang_word": "Nisan",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Nisan",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6daadb6e-bf3b-3075-9d44-fda5b377e812",
                                        "entry_id": "69b0ef1e-79b2-39ec-99d2-b79f63f4ac96",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The seventh month of the civil year and the first month of the ecclesiastical year in the Jewish calendar, after Adar and before Iyar."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Judaism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7bf384a-cb71-4c23-b024-74315641a7be",
                                                "sense_id": "6daadb6e-bf3b-3075-9d44-fda5b377e812",
                                                "text": "Micky Vayner shrugged; as far as he knew, it was, by the lunar calendar, an ordinary day in the month of Nisan."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bce93b22-9da6-4cc0-a389-ae1475fdd1fb",
                        "source_entry_id": "c0a38299-5e7d-31e7-9849-4b9a1d1d36f9",
                        "source_sense_id": "fa61671f-2c63-3442-8f42-ad22cea00f0b",
                        "target_lang_word": "Nissan",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Nissan",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b842426-31ff-3a08-baae-15fbdb60dfd4",
                                        "entry_id": "9ed49ac4-d19f-3556-96c7-5b1b905998bf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A Japanese car manufacturer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77d5a111-df3d-4e09-8582-c4f30da089e3",
                                                "sense_id": "7b842426-31ff-3a08-baae-15fbdb60dfd4",
                                                "text": "The Bluebird dispute is being watched closely in Europe and overseas because the 2,000-employee Nissan plant at Sunderland, England, near Newcastle, represents the largest direct investment by the Japanese in Europe."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Nissan",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "53eaee2c-aec2-31b8-b5e1-362c424b17b4",
                                        "entry_id": "f478204d-4902-397a-876c-afffe05101d0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A car of the Japanese Nissan brand."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed05d6c4-4c8f-4f9d-b433-a52f193a6ba3",
                                                "sense_id": "53eaee2c-aec2-31b8-b5e1-362c424b17b4",
                                                "text": "Angry Japanese and British officials say foreign investors will be scared away from Europe unless France and Italy ease tough regulations that treat English-made Nissans as Japanese cars, subjecting them to strict import quotas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8732e83b-9b56-46d5-9102-3df11ad3c0fd",
                                                "sense_id": "53eaee2c-aec2-31b8-b5e1-362c424b17b4",
                                                "text": "A Jaguar and two Nissans battled into the early morning hours in the closely contested Daytona 24 Hours, with a group of Porsches still within reach of the leaders."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcaf406d-20d0-411d-a9e8-f35091108f98",
                                                "sense_id": "53eaee2c-aec2-31b8-b5e1-362c424b17b4",
                                                "text": "Like other Nissans, the Ariya gets the excellent ProPilot system for cruise control and part-autonomous driving – far less fiddly than the set-up of some of its competitors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Nissan",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc92a77b-3d14-3cff-b631-af06f29a3114",
                                        "entry_id": "d4baa116-ed11-3284-a1f8-7644f9c98ffa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of Nisan (“the Hebrew month”)."
